=== accelerator-collaboration --help ===
The `accelerator-collaboration` command-line surface

Usage: accelerator-collaboration <COMMAND>

Commands:
  pr    Pull-request operations
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== accelerator-collaboration pr --help ===
Pull-request operations

Usage: accelerator-collaboration pr <COMMAND>

Commands:
  base-repo    Resolve a PR's base (upstream) owner/repo; prints "<owner>/<repo>"
  update-body  Update a PR's body from a file
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== accelerator-collaboration pr base-repo --help ===
Resolve a PR's base (upstream) owner/repo; prints "<owner>/<repo>"

Usage: accelerator-collaboration pr base-repo <PULL_NUMBER>

Arguments:
  <PULL_NUMBER>  

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== accelerator-collaboration pr update-body --help ===
Update a PR's body from a file

Usage: accelerator-collaboration pr update-body --body-file <BODY_FILE> <PULL_NUMBER>

Arguments:
  <PULL_NUMBER>  

Options:
      --body-file <BODY_FILE>  
  -h, --help                   Print help

